From 89f2e6ef0e2ed651a2de70673fdddc26cfe7481f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Suman <sumaninster7@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 09:30:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: mobile responsiveness, performance optimization, and UX
 improvements

- Add mobile hamburger menu with collapsible nav panel (fixes sign out overflow)
- Parallelize API calls on metrics page and patient detail page
- Add loading skeletons for patients list, patient detail, and metrics page
- Add loading.tsx for instant route transition feedback
- Fix create patient form layout on mobile (stack fields vertically)
- Fix patient detail action buttons wrapping on mobile
- Fix metrics page header buttons stacking on mobile
- Fix audit trail, safety reports, guideline results for mobile
- Fix encounter results header and suggestion card buttons for mobile
- Add CSS for minimum touch targets (44px) on mobile
- Prevent iOS zoom on input focus (16px font-size)
- Add overflow-x: hidden to prevent horizontal scroll
- Add preconnect/dns-prefetch for API domain
- Add proper viewport meta tag via Next.js Viewport export
- Enable Next.js compress and static asset caching headers
- Improve loading spinners (animated spinner instead of plain text)
